TODO: Choose a license before making this repository public.

Current status: All rights reserved (personal project, design phase)

Recommended options:
- MIT          — permissive, good for portfolio/showcase
- Apache-2.0   — permissive with patent clause
- GPL-3.0      — copyleft, ensures derivatives stay open

Decision criteria:
- If this is purely for learning/portfolio → MIT
- If you expect commercial use of derivatives → Apache-2.0
- If you want to enforce openness in derivatives → GPL-3.0

Note: This is a design document repository (no production code yet).
      License choice matters more when actual code is populated in Stage 2.

See: https://choosealicense.com/ for comparison
